Package: xr_teleoperate
Version: 1.0.0
Section: robotics
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: illusory <1596303130@qq.com>
Depends: bash, coreutils, openssl, ca-certificates, iproute2, net-tools, systemd, sudo
Recommends: libgl1, libgomp1, ssh-server, kmod
Description: XR Teleoperator main program (Unitree G1_29)
 Installs the VR teleoperator code at /opt/xr-teleoperate-main,
 two systemd units (xr-teleimager, xr-heartbeat), and
 the helper CLI /usr/bin/xr-teleop-control.
 .
 The high-risk VR teleop program scripts/start_teleop.sh is NOT
 registered as a systemd service (no enable, no autostart); it must be
 launched manually on site: xr-teleop-control teleop
 .
 At install time, a postinst step installs Miniconda (if missing) and
 reloads systemd. The user then runs `xr-teleop-control install-env`
 to create the 'tv' conda environment with all Python deps
 (see /opt/xr-teleoperate-main/.deb-build/tv-env.yml).
 .
 After install: sudo -u unitree xr-teleop-control install-env
 Then:          xr-teleop-control start
 .
